(3430833, 478248, 57378, '<td valign="top">I am sure you will get many "too small" comments. Not sure if it is intentional but the sloping horizon and off balance picture makes it awkward to look at.</td>', 'I am sure you will get many "too small" comments. Not sure if it is intentional but the sloping horizon and off balance picture makes it awkward to look at.', '2007-03-05 14:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
