(3430840, 479191, 57378, '<td valign="top">I knew, I knew, I knew, there had to be one at the beach - I tried for 2 days to convince my girlfriend to go and she flatly refused - Time to get a new girlfriend I say! Well done for all the effort - What ever happens in this challenge you will still have a great pic to talk about for many years - Again well done - I know that took a lot of effort. Looks very CA to me??? Loving the slippers.</td>', 'I knew, I knew, I knew, there had to be one at the beach - I tried for 2 days to convince my girlfriend to go and she flatly refused - Time to get a new girlfriend I say! Well done for all the effort - What ever happens in this challenge you will still have a great pic to talk about for many years - Again well done - I know that took a lot of effort. Looks very CA to me??? Loving the slippers.', '2007-03-05 14:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3430843, 479455, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - Very serene - If there is just a small negative it would be the reflected highlight above the chair - for some reason i find it very distracting. Place your thumb over it and i think you will agree.</td>', 'Nice capture - Very serene - If there is just a small negative it would be the reflected highlight above the chair - for some reason i find it very distracting. Place your thumb over it and i think you will agree.', '2007-03-05 14:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
