(3430857, 479083, 57378, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - Nice and crisp - Love the colours just find the table a little distracting yet the table gives it depth.</td>', 'Nice capture - Nice and crisp - Love the colours just find the table a little distracting yet the table gives it depth.', '2007-03-05 14:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
