(3431002, 479267, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great capture - What a shame though that you cropped out the chair leg??? Why did that happen?? The green is a great contrast to all the browns but just loses it on the crop. Maybe the chair on the wagon it''s self could have been more dramatic??</td>', 'Great capture - What a shame though that you cropped out the chair leg??? Why did that happen?? The green is a great contrast to all the browns but just loses it on the crop. Maybe the chair on the wagon it''s self could have been more dramatic??', '2007-03-05 15:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3431006, 475895, 57378, '<td valign="top">Great capture - Almost feel it could have been more powerful if you had selected just one table and chairs and shot it face on? The cropped furniture in the foreground is a little distracting.</td>', 'Great capture - Almost feel it could have been more powerful if you had selected just one table and chairs and shot it face on? The cropped furniture in the foreground is a little distracting.', '2007-03-05 15:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
