about the composition - but I would have cropped a tad differently to be honest.  PS: this is the third longest comment I''ve ever left and the first where I jokingly said that something sucked.  LOL ROFLMAOAPTPWMF!!!!  8', '2007-03-05 21:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
