(3436116, 479147, 69776, '<td valign="top">What a great chair, sort of looks out of place in such a modern setting.  I like being able to let my eyes roam up the stairs but table on the right is a bit distracting as is the piece under the stairs.  Good Luck</td>', 'What a great chair, sort of looks out of place in such a modern setting.  I like being able to let my eyes roam up the stairs but table on the right is a bit distracting as is the piece under the stairs.  Good Luck', '2007-03-07 02:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
