(3443149, 477781, 62318, '<td valign="top">Not sure about this one, Judi (?). I''m not a fan of back shots, light seems a little harsh, not sure about the crop/frame. I like the idea though and the colors really pop. Just not the execution on this one.</td>', 'Not sure about this one, Judi (?). I''m not a fan of back shots, light seems a little harsh, not sure about the crop/frame. I like the idea though and the colors really pop. Just not the execution on this one.', '2007-03-08 12:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3443154, 479071, 73235, '<td valign="top">very funny interpretation of the challenge, a little more focus on the chariman</td>', 'very funny interpretation of the challenge, a little more focus on the chariman', '2007-03-08 12:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3443159, 479429, 62318, '<td valign="top">What I really like about the picture is not so much the action, which is pretty funny, but actually the shadows on the wall. Generally flash/light shadows are a bad thing, but I think it really give a lot of interest to the photo. The only shadow I don''t like is the one on in the bottom left corner. <br/> <br/>If you could have fixed the White balance on this photo (make the whites really white) and have a bit more contrast you would have a stunner. Still above average rating.</td>', 'What I really like about the picture is not so much the action, which is pretty funny, but actually the shadows on the wall. Generally flash/light shadows are a bad thing, but I think it really give a lot of interest to the photo. The only shadow I don''t like is the one on in the bottom left corner.  If you could have fixed the White balance on this photo (make the whites really white) and have a bit more contrast you would have a stunner. Still above average rating.', '2007-03-08 12:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3443169, 479332, 62318, '<td valign="top">Good classic shot. Wonderful colors and sharpness. Great use of the frame, and wonderful lines. It''s one of those "I''ve seen this before" type pictures, but it is still a stunner nonetheless.<br/> <br/>Highly rated.</td>', 'Good classic shot. Wonderful colors and sharpness. Great use of the frame, and wonderful lines. It''s one of those "I''ve seen this before" type pictures, but it is still a stunner nonetheless. Highly rated.', '2007-03-08 12:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3443177, 479016, 62318, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the black strap is... I think a piece of lingerie or something similar might have appealed to me more as I don''t get the context. However, it is still a wonderful picture. Love the textures here with the use of different types of blankets. The lines you created in the folds of the blankets are superb. The wonderful soft light coming adds a nice touch, makes me want to jump in and take a nap.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the black strap is... I think a piece of lingerie or something similar might have appealed to me more as I don''t get the context. However, it is still a wonderful picture. Love the textures here with the use of different types of blankets. The lines you created in the folds of the blankets are superb. The wonderful soft light coming adds a nice touch, makes me want to jump in and take a nap.', '2007-03-08 12:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3443184, 478203, 62318, '<td valign="top">I''m not a selective saturation kind of person, but it works here. I really like the simplicity of the picture, with the slight mess on the wall. Everything is wonderful, including the light and lines. Wonderful balance to the photo and good use of the frame. Highly rated.</td>', 'I''m not a selective saturation kind of person, but it works here. I really like the simplicity of the picture, with the slight mess on the wall. Everything is wonderful, including the light and lines. Wonderful balance to the photo and good use of the frame. Highly rated.', '2007-03-08 12:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3443249, 476965, 54431, '<td valign="top">I really like the tones and contrast in this. Great work!</td>', 'I really like the tones and contrast in this. Great work!', '2007-03-08 13:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
