(3447651, 478987, 66524, '<td valign="top">I like your concept, but I think the other side of the street takes away from your original intent of shooting for "park life".  I am the first to understand the desire to keep that line of perspective, but I think you missed out on a different point of view given how the benches are lined up along with the trees in the background.</td>', 'I like your concept, but I think the other side of the street takes away from your original intent of shooting for "park life".  I am the first to understand the desire to keep that line of perspective, but I think you missed out on a different point of view given how the benches are lined up along with the trees in the background.', '2007-03-09 22:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3447669, 479166, 66524, '<td valign="top">IMHO, the design motif on the chair back competes with the rush of the water.  Additionally, the tonal qualities of the water are much more appealing that the garish reality of the (same said) motif.  The photo seems too busy</td>', 'IMHO, the design motif on the chair back competes with the rush of the water.  Additionally, the tonal qualities of the water are much more appealing that the garish reality of the (same said) motif.  The photo seems too busy', '2007-03-09 22:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
