(3447803, 479192, 66524, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a beautiful wood grain to work with and I wish the focus was on that...especially the bottom portion. As is, the crop leaves off the right <b>cabinet</b> foot (I don''t think this is a dresser).  Other distractions on the lower right, left curtains and background wall items could have been left out.  You have a nice piece of furniture though...5</td>', 'There seems to be a beautiful wood grain to work with and I wish the focus was on that...especially the bottom portion. As is, the crop leaves off the right cabinet foot (I don''t think this is a dresser).  Other distractions on the lower right, left curtains and background wall items could have been left out.  You have a nice piece of furniture though...5', '2007-03-09 23:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3447816, 479211, 66524, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo - reminds of the Chautauqua Institute in New York.  I wonder if a tighter crop would serve the challenge better and getting rid of the jacket on the chair back (it''s distracting).  I love the shadow on the porch!  I can feel the warmth of the day.  I hope you place well. 7</td>', 'Lovely photo - reminds of the Chautauqua Institute in New York.  I wonder if a tighter crop would serve the challenge better and getting rid of the jacket on the chair back (it''s distracting).  I love the shadow on the porch!  I can feel the warmth of the day.  I hope you place well. 7', '2007-03-10 00:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3447830, 479221, 66524, '<td valign="top">It''s a great atmosphere and I like how the light shines through. Photo seems too dark, but not enough to vote down.  Wall molding at the curtain edge looks like another table leg, and the potpourri isn''t needed in the shot.</td>', 'It''s a great atmosphere and I like how the light shines through. Photo seems too dark, but not enough to vote down.  Wall molding at the curtain edge looks like another table leg, and the potpourri isn''t needed in the shot.', '2007-03-10 00:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
