(3449275, 477041, 66524, '<td valign="top">I am sure there is a rich wood grain to this fine family heirloom, but your perspective does not highlight that feature.  As is, it looks like a snap shot for insurance purposes.  I am no expert, but many comments to <b>me</b> have stated..."walk around your subject"  "focus on an aspect you want the viewer to see" "shoot as many shots as possible" "set up different arrangements".  That said, I don''t want to seem "all knowing" - rather just to "pay it forward" from what I have learned.  Good luck in the challenge  :)</td>', 'I am sure there is a rich wood grain to this fine family heirloom, but your perspective does not highlight that feature.  As is, it looks like a snap shot for insurance purposes.  I am no expert, but many comments to me have stated..."walk around your subject"  "focus on an aspect you want the viewer to see" "shoot as many shots as possible" "set up different arrangements".  That said, I don''t want to seem "all knowing" - rather just to "pay it forward" from what I have learned.  Good luck in the challenge  :)', '2007-03-10 19:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
