(3452400, 479332, 56797, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the score and placement but western, eh? :P Everytime you and the missis do a western type photo I start to wonder about you guys. please, <b>pleeeeeease</b> step away from the dark side. More goth, less western..Ohhhh..OOOooooOOOoooo! OR you guys could both do shots were a goth charater beats up the western one. :D..yeaaaaah, I can imagine it now. mmmmm...yup, than all would be right with the world..lol <br/> <br/>j/k</td>', 'Congrats on the score and placement but western, eh? :P Everytime you and the missis do a western type photo I start to wonder about you guys. please, pleeeeeease step away from the dark side. More goth, less western..Ohhhh..OOOooooOOOoooo! OR you guys could both do shots were a goth charater beats up the western one. :D..yeaaaaah, I can imagine it now. mmmmm...yup, than all would be right with the world..lol  j/k', '2007-03-12 08:13:46.000000', NULL, 0),
