(3452468, 479147, 66597, '<td valign="top">Raish, I kept coming back to this one during the challenge because you have the coolest pad in the world! That staircase just rocks! I am envious. I really like this photo aside from that as well. I like how you have to search for the little kitty on the big sofa - and what a cool sofa it is!</td>', 'Raish, I kept coming back to this one during the challenge because you have the coolest pad in the world! That staircase just rocks! I am envious. I really like this photo aside from that as well. I like how you have to search for the little kitty on the big sofa - and what a cool sofa it is!', '2007-03-12 08:50:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3452469, 479303, 66348, '<td valign="top">Just a beautiful image. Congrats on your first ribbon. Just a really great setup and shot!!</td>', 'Just a beautiful image. Congrats on your first ribbon. Just a really great setup and shot!!', '2007-03-12 08:50:39.000000', NULL, 0),
