(3453077, 478203, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ian, this is awesome!!  I think it is really underrated!  I wonder.  DPC voters seem to be inappropriately psycho-obsessed with that rule of thirds thing -- I wonder if the chair were over closer to the yellow sign, if alot of them would have rated this with a much higher score and that explains the underratement.  I just love how simple it is, and the yellow splash of color on an urban looking photo.   Great job.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ian, this is awesome!!  I think it is really underrated!  I wonder.  DPC voters seem to be inappropriately psycho-obsessed with that rule of thirds thing -- I wonder if the chair were over closer to the yellow sign, if alot of them would have rated this with a much higher score and that explains the underratement.  I just love how simple it is, and the yellow splash of color on an urban looking photo.   Great job. ', '2007-03-12 11:47:33.000000', NULL, 0),
