(3454561, 479429, 51538, '<td valign="top">I gave a 7 when voting and came back to find out more.  Your description is humorous.  I like the idea and the composition.  As said, the shadows are nicely dramatic.  The sepia-like lighting is also rather nice.  I think with a stronger directional light you could have kept the shadows but gained a greater depth of field with f/8 or so.  That would have helped with the focus.  But then again, what do I know.  I am learning - and have learned something from your great set up.  Thanks.</td>', 'I gave a 7 when voting and came back to find out more.  Your description is humorous.  I like the idea and the composition.  As said, the shadows are nicely dramatic.  The sepia-like lighting is also rather nice.  I think with a stronger directional light you could have kept the shadows but gained a greater depth of field with f/8 or so.  That would have helped with the focus.  But then again, what do I know.  I am learning - and have learned something from your great set up.  Thanks.', '2007-03-12 19:39:13.000000', NULL, 0),
