(3458590, 479244, 30982, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I really like the way you processed it - not over the top but helps set the mood and really bring out the tones and textures.  Congrats on the over-6 score, and a good bit over 6 at that.  Based on what you''ve entered so far and what''s in your portfolio, I can''t help but think nearly everything you enter will be over 6.  Nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful!  I really like the way you processed it - not over the top but helps set the mood and really bring out the tones and textures.  Congrats on the over-6 score, and a good bit over 6 at that.  Based on what you''ve entered so far and what''s in your portfolio, I can''t help but think nearly everything you enter will be over 6.  Nice work.', '2007-03-14 03:24:06.000000', NULL, 0),
