(4327816, 479190, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous cat!  And I see little kitty knick-knacks on the nightstand, kind of echoing her form.  Very nice composition and the lighting is fabulous.</td>', 'What a gorgeous cat!  And I see little kitty knick-knacks on the nightstand, kind of echoing her form.  Very nice composition and the lighting is fabulous.', '2007-12-21 09:51:58.000000', NULL, 0),
